### Recommendation Background Tasks API Tests
### This file tests the new background task functionality for recommendation endpoints

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@authToken = your_auth_token_here
@userId = 1

### 1. Generate Recommendations (Background Task)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "task_id": "rec_gen_1_1703123456.789",
###   "status": "processing",
###   "message": "Recommendation generation started in background",
###   "user_id": 1,
###   "created_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00"
### }

### 2. Check Task Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/task/rec_gen_1_1703123456.789
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "task_id": "rec_gen_1_1703123456.789",
###   "status": "processing|completed|failed",
###   "message": "Current status message",
###   "created_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00",
###   "completed_at": "2024-01-01T12:05:00",
###   "result": {
###     "recommendation_id": 123,
###     "user_level": "intermediate",
###     "coordination_uuid": "uuid-string"
###   },
###   "error_details": null,
###   "user_id": 1,
###   "task_type": "recommendation_generation"
### }

### 3. Custom Text Analysis (Background Task)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/custom-text-analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text_content": "I want to improve my social media presence and grow my following. I'm currently posting 3 times a week and have 5,000 followers. What should I do?",
  "user_id": {{userId}}
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "task_id": "custom_analysis_1703123456.789",
###   "status": "processing",
###   "message": "Custom text analysis started in background",
###   "user_id": 1,
###   "text_content_length": 150,
###   "created_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00"
### }

### 4. Check Custom Text Analysis Task Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/task/custom_analysis_1703123456.789
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get All Tasks for User
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/tasks/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "tasks": [
###     {
###       "task_id": "rec_gen_1_1703123456.789",
###       "status": "completed",
###       "message": "Recommendation generated successfully",
###       "created_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00",
###       "completed_at": "2024-01-01T12:05:00",
###       "result": {...},
###       "user_id": 1,
###       "task_type": "recommendation_generation"
###     }
###   ],
###   "total": 1,
###   "page": 1,
###   "page_size": 1
### }

### 6. Get Tasks by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/tasks/user/{{userId}}?task_type=recommendation_generation
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Get Tasks by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/tasks/status/completed
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "tasks": [...],
###   "total": 5,
###   "status": "completed"
### }

### 8. Trigger Analysis (Background Task)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/trigger-analysis/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "task_id": "analysis_trigger_1_1703123456.789",
###   "status": "processing",
###   "message": "Analysis triggered for user 1 in background",
###   "user_id": 1,
###   "created_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00"
### }

### 9. Get Existing Recommendations (Still works as before)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Get Specific Recommendation
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/123
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Update Recommendation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/123
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_level": "advanced",
  "base_plan": {
    "level": "advanced",
    "posting_frequency": "daily posts"
  }
}

### 12. Delete Recommendation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/123
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "message": "Recommendation deleted successfully"
### }

### 13. Test Error Handling - Invalid Task ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/task/invalid_task_id
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "detail": "Task not found"
### }

### 14. Test Error Handling - Invalid User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/tasks/user/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "tasks": [],
###   "total": 0,
###   "page": 1,
###   "page_size": 0
### }

### 15. Test Multiple Concurrent Tasks
### Generate multiple recommendations simultaneously
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate/3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Then check all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/tasks/status/processing
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Test Task Status Progression
### Start a task and monitor its status changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Wait a few seconds, then check status multiple times
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/task/{{task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Status should progress from "processing" to "completed" or "failed"
### Messages should update to show current step:
### - "Getting user profile..."
### - "Analyzing user profile..."
### - "Getting AI agent recommendations..."
### - "Generating influencer plan recommendations..."
### - "Saving recommendation to database..."
### - "Recommendation generated successfully"
